### ⏯ Playground Link

https://www.typescriptlang.org/play/?#code/KYOwrgtgBAolDeAoKKoAYRQLzsQXyA

### 💻 Code

```ts
enum E {
    0n = 0
}
```


### 🙁 Actual behavior

Transformed to
```js
"use strict";
var E;
(function (E) {
    E[E[0n] = 0] = 0n;
})(E || (E = {}));

```
without error

